{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Untold Winter is a first person shooter set in a dark fantasy world where a never ending winter fell upon the world. Use your firearms, magical spells and your shield to conquer the terrors of this wintry world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master combat and defeat the deadly terrors of the night.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > <strong>Magic and Firearms</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3459610/extras/5725f42aeb369cae4b5a44d245f90261.poster.avif?t=1759771416\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3459610/extras/5725f42aeb369cae4b5a44d245f90261.webm?t=1759771416\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3459610/extras/5725f42aeb369cae4b5a44d245f90261.mp4?t=1759771416\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Even while holding guns you still can cast spells. Combine your firearms with magic: stop time with your rifle ammunition or electrify your enemies in place. Parry, dash, cast spells and shoot your way through. Choose between a slow but precise bolt-action rifle, a fast firing machine gun, a powerful shotgun ideal for closed-ranged combat or your loyal 6-chambered revolver. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Spell Casting - Magic Only Combat</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3459610/extras/a6ead52d6f1894af9e5ac9bacfc95dbc.poster.avif?t=1759771416\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3459610/extras/a6ead52d6f1894af9e5ac9bacfc95dbc.webm?t=1759771416\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3459610/extras/a6ead52d6f1894af9e5ac9bacfc95dbc.mp4?t=1759771416\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find Scrolls of Knowledge, invest your points to increase your magic affinity and cast fireballs, lightning bolts and warp time itself with your bare hands.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u00a0The Heavy Shield -</strong>\u00a0<strong>Ragdoll Physics</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3459610/extras/92d9b229bcff6727ade3ddb442f1e13e.poster.avif?t=1759771416\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3459610/extras/92d9b229bcff6727ade3ddb442f1e13e.webm?t=1759771416\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3459610/extras/92d9b229bcff6727ade3ddb442f1e13e.mp4?t=1759771416\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Consume your stamina to block incoming attacks. A well-timed block will parry the attacker and stun it for a brief moment. The Shield can also be used to push an enemy away and knockdown others.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Explore a Dark Fantasy Wintry World</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3459610/extras/bca8b66b7a02809251ae6f0ac1611a56.poster.avif?t=1759771416\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3459610/extras/bca8b66b7a02809251ae6f0ac1611a56.webm?t=1759771416\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3459610/extras/bca8b66b7a02809251ae6f0ac1611a56.mp4?t=1759771416\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Navigate through a parasitic cave infested with infected creatures, a dangerous dungeon or a heavily guarded fortress. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Bosses</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3459610/extras/dab628e226c7a9560d8f4f82eedc4c45.poster.avif?t=1759771416\" width=600 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3459610/extras/dab628e226c7a9560d8f4f82eedc4c45.webm?t=1759771416\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3459610/extras/dab628e226c7a9560d8f4f82eedc4c45.mp4?t=1759771416\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face powerful unique enemies that haunt the world. Defeat and cleanse the world from these horrors. Bosses and tougher enemies must be dealt with care, skill and planning. Manage your stamina, block, parry and dodge incoming attacks to survive.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>World Lore</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3459610/extras/2f877052af79a0dfce171dcff2056574.poster.avif?t=1759771416\" width=596 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3459610/extras/2f877052af79a0dfce171dcff2056574.webm?t=1759771416\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3459610/extras/2f877052af79a0dfce171dcff2056574.mp4?t=1759771416\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Winter King has bought an endless cold upon the world, where all things dead have arisen. His army of all cold creatures and himself march south to conquer the known world. Can you bring this eternal night to an end?\u00a0 \u00a0  </p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3459610?t=1759771416","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3459610?t=1759771416","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3459610/91e346160771050d123ea2a3a40e0bb9f95f2ff9/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759771416","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3459610/91e346160771050d123ea2a3a40e0bb9f95f2ff9/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1759771416","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"The game contains violence, firearms and decapitation."},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Untold Winter is a first person shooter set in a dark fantasy world where a never ending winter fell upon the world. Use your firearms, magical spells and your shield to conquer the terrors of this wintry world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master combat and defeat the deadly terrors of the night.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > <strong>Magic and Firearms</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3459610/extras/5725f42aeb369cae4b5a44d245f90261.poster.avif?t=1759771416\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3459610/extras/5725f42aeb369cae4b5a44d245f90261.webm?t=1759771416\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3459610/extras/5725f42aeb369cae4b5a44d245f90261.mp4?t=1759771416\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>